{
  "id": "u06-l07b",
  "unit": "u06-bazaar",
  "title": "Change, bags & the best",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Before paying with a big note, ask **ভাংতি আছে?** 'Do you have change?' **ভাংতি** and **খুচরা** both mean 'change' (small notes and coins); Kolkata says খুচরো. Vendors often can't break ৳500 or ৳1,000.\n\nBring your own **ব্যাগ** (bag): many markets now discourage plastic bags. **আমার ব্যাগ লাগবে না** = 'I don't need a bag'.\n\n**সবচেয়ে** + adjective = 'the most …': **সবচেয়ে ভালো** 'the best', **সবচেয়ে সস্তা** 'the cheapest'.\n\n**জিনিস** is 'thing(s)': **সব জিনিস** 'everything'.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "bhangti",
      "bn": "ভাংতি",
      "tr": "bhangti",
      "en": "change",
      "notes": "Small notes/coins. Drivers and vendors often lack change for a ৳500 or ৳1000 note. খুচরা means the same and is equally common; both are fine."
    },
    {
      "id": "khuchra",
      "bn": "খুচরা",
      "tr": "khuchra",
      "en": "change",
      "notes": "Same meaning as ভাংতি; both are common in Bangladesh (খুচরা is also the usual written word)."
    },
    {
      "id": "byag",
      "bn": "ব্যাগ",
      "tr": "byag",
      "en": "bag"
    },
    {
      "id": "jinish",
      "bn": "জিনিস",
      "tr": "jinish",
      "en": "thing"
    },
    {
      "id": "shobcheye",
      "bn": "সবচেয়ে",
      "tr": "shobcheye",
      "en": "the most",
      "notes": "সবচেয়ে + adjective = superlative: সবচেয়ে ভালো \"the best\", সবচেয়ে সস্তা \"the cheapest\"."
    }
  ],
